msgid "当前源码版本号保持 0.2.1；已发布版本仍以 [GitHub Releases](https://github.com/X-Gen-Lab/nexus/releases)和其固定 manifest 为准。 重构不移动旧标签，不重新标记旧产物。"
msgstr "The current source version remains 0.2.1. Published versions are defined by [GitHub Releases](https://github.com/X-Gen-Lab/nexus/releases) and their fixed manifests. The refactor does not move existing tags or relabel old artifacts."

msgid "本轮架构迭代以固定源码 [`a2b74d82`](https://github.com/X-Gen-Lab/nexus/tree/a2b74d826dc1545aa8f51b5fcbc05fcd1cc2c984) 为既有基础。该版本已有的流式传输、恢复和勘误修正，与本轮工作包新增内容分别记录。 本轮便携 I/O 的平台实现为 [`6b59f666`](https://github.com/X-Gen-Lab/nexus/tree/6b59f66628f0dbb415f6203ba917c1fe717bf3fd)， 其 Debug、Release、ASAN+UBSAN 和 TSAN 各执行完整 329 个 CTest 项、5982 个 GoogleTest 用例并通过。最终 [`4bf4b5a2`](https://github.com/X-Gen-Lab/nexus/tree/4bf4b5a258b3120c24f6d834545ac3f300ce801b) 仅继续迁移 TMP117 SDK 调用者；编译输入审计确认该文件不属于上述四种 Native 程序的输入，没有把前次运行写成该提交重新执行。"
msgstr "This architecture iteration retains the fixed source [`a2b74d82`](https://github.com/X-Gen-Lab/nexus/tree/a2b74d826dc1545aa8f51b5fcbc05fcd1cc2c984) as its existing foundation. Streaming, recovery and errata fixes already present there are recorded separately from this iteration's work-package increments. The portable I/O platform implementation is [`6b59f666`](https://github.com/X-Gen-Lab/nexus/tree/6b59f66628f0dbb415f6203ba917c1fe717bf3fd); Debug, Release, ASAN+UBSAN and TSAN each passed the complete 329 CTest entries and 5982 GoogleTest cases. The final [`4bf4b5a2`](https://github.com/X-Gen-Lab/nexus/tree/4bf4b5a258b3120c24f6d834545ac3f300ce801b) only continues the TMP117 SDK caller migration. A compiler-input audit confirms that file is not an input to those four Native programs; the earlier runs are not relabeled as executions at that commit."

msgid "`4bf4b5a2` 的 clean-source SDK 已完成导出、验证、整体搬移、全部 34 个维护消费者 和消费后验证，165 条消费者子命令全部成功。SDK manifest、完整报告、失败尝试、 产物身份与本地交付包的校验值见 PR #62；它们不表示已上传 Release 附件。文档与 ARM 参考构建保留各自原始输入；[验收边界](qualification.md)说明不同结果的适用范围。 实板和远端 Actions 按用户要求暂缓，软件验收使用本地门禁。"
msgstr "The clean-source SDK at `4bf4b5a2` completed export, verification, whole-prefix relocation, all 34 maintained consumers and post-consumption verification; all 165 consumer subcommands succeeded. PR #62 identifies the SDK manifest, complete reports, failed attempts, artifact identities and local delivery-package checksums; these do not imply uploaded Release assets. Documentation and ARM reference builds retain their original inputs; [acceptance boundaries](qualification.md) explain each result's scope. Physical tests and remote Actions are deferred at the user's request; software acceptance uses local gates."

msgid "退出平台的原始实现和记录可从 [重构前固定源码](https://github.com/X-Gen-Lab/nexus/tree/8e147fc2c812d81ab6596e0d1a6bc8908d30ac18) 追溯。原日志、来源和状态保持原身份，恢复或阅读它们不授予新源码资格。"
msgstr "Retired implementations and records remain traceable at the [fixed pre-refactor source](https://github.com/X-Gen-Lab/nexus/tree/8e147fc2c812d81ab6596e0d1a6bc8908d30ac18). Original logs, sources and states retain their identities; restoring or reading them does not qualify the new source."
